  "Bryan: 60+ strict continuous reps (chest to floor, zero top pauses). Harvard study: 40+ push-ups correlated with 96% lower cardiovascular events.": "Bryan: 60+ strenge kontinuerlige reps (bryst til gulv, null topp pauser). Harvard-studie: 40+ push-ups korrelerte med 96 % lavere kardiovaskulære hendelser.",
  "Bryan: 75": "Bryan: 75",
